					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Qui hanc tibi schedulam reddit, <persName>Iohannes Helmichius</persName> nomin<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>e, patria Traiectensis, doctissimus et piissimus homo, ad triennium <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>fere Hebraeas literas in schola <placeName ref="l280">Lausanensi</placeName> docuit publice.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Nunc ab ecclesia <placeName ref="l15">Antverpiana</placeName> vocatur ad ministerium illius, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quam vocationem sequitur, licet cum maximo sit periculo con<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>iuncta et aegre a nobis dimissus sit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Te tamen cupit ante <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>videre; itaque <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> una cum d. <persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName> proficiscitur et <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>rogavit, ut privata scedula ad te scriberem, quo illi li<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>berior sit te affandi et accedendi copia.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quod homini <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>mihi charissimo, et qui <persName>Blasio</persName> meo coniunctissimus <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>fuit, denegare non potui.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Habet secum etiam quosdam alios <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>studiosos <placeName ref="l808">Belgas</placeName>, qui <placeName ref="l167">Genevę</placeName> literis operam dederunt; <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>illos tuę pietati et charitati commendo.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>27. iulii 1566.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/><persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Postquam has absolvi, a senatu decretum est, ut d. quęstor <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>et ego quoque <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>proficiscamur deliberaturi <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>una vobiscum et cum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/><placeName ref="l167">Genevensibus</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>(quos heri scripsi cum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><persName ref="p772">Datheno</persName> venisse, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/><persName ref="p8033">Bezam</persName> et <persName ref="p2740">Rosetum</persName>) super negotium <lb xml:id="p1z24"/><placeName ref="l142">Erdfurdiensi</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName> fortassis <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>praecedet <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>nos; nam die lunę <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>adhuc coram senatu nos <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>esse oportet.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Scribitur etiam <placeName ref="l441">Scaphusianis</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>ut adsint.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Horum t<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>e praemonere hisce literis volui.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Plura coram aut per <persName ref="p8033">Bezam</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae pastori <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>fidelissimo, patri et <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>compatri meo o<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>bservandissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>